      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey i'm trying to put together a quick post for social media about why all these new environmental and labor regulations are basically just killing small businesses and stopping people from actually building anything. can u help me write a few points that show how this kind of government overreach is just holding back the economy and making it impossible for anyone but the huge corporations to succeed?",
